  hintId: tutorial_training_6
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Training - Match Case
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "Before, we handled multiple conditions using the <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>if</color></font> and <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>else</color></font>
    statements. However, there is another decision-making statements. \n\nA <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>match</color></font> statement takes a single value and
    compares it against a list of possibilities, executing only the specific <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>case</color></font> that matches perfectly. \n\nThe objective
    here is similar to before, the environment is still unstable and will generate
    a random mineral every time!\nAlso, the <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>if</color></font>
    keyword has been temporarily banned. \n\nYou must solve this level by using <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>match</color></font> and <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#D96DD3>case</color></font>."
  isImageBig: 0
